            {"heading": "The Content Minimum Viable Approach", "body": ["You don't need to be everywhere. You need to be visible and consistent somewhere.", "Choose one medium (written, video, audio), one platform (LinkedIn for most B2B professionals, YouTube for video creators, a podcast for audio), and one cadence you can sustain (weekly is ideal; monthly is better than nothing).", "The content that builds reputation is not generic advice that anyone could give — it's specific perspective drawn from your specific experience. The counterintuitive observation. The nuance that most content in your field misses. The case study from your specific domain."]},
