            {"heading": "The Active LinkedIn Approach", "body": ["Profile optimization: headline that describes your value proposition, not just your current title. About section that tells a professional story. Skills and experiences that reflect where you're going, not just where you've been.", "Content creation: one substantive post per week. Not viral bait — specific professional insight drawn from your experience and expertise.", "Engagement: thoughtful comments on content by people in your target audience or target industries. This builds visibility with specific communities faster than posting alone.", "Outreach: personalized connection requests with a specific reason for connecting. Not 'I'd like to add you to my network' — 'I read your piece on X and wanted to connect because I work in a related area and found your point about Y particularly useful.'"]},
